-- Generated data for g9-battle-sprites (party-menu icons). Do not edit by hand.
--  * species: national_dex species id -> icon name in the pack
--  * female:  base icon name -> the pack's female variant (when it has one)
--  * base:    icon name -> its first atlas cell (cell+0 and cell+1)
-- Source: the pack's `icones animados` folder -- one 128x64 PNG per icon,
-- two 64x64 animation frames side by side.  TWO atlases are packed from it,
-- row-major, from the same sorted icon list with two frames each, so a cell
-- INDEX means the same icon in both and the one `base` table indexes either:
--   assets/icons/party_icons.png     cell=x16, cols -- the party list's own
--                                    16x16 slot (point-sampled 4:1: the
--                                    `cell`/`cols`/`rows` fields above)
--   assets/icons/party_icons_hd.png  cell=x64, hdCols -- the g9 party screen,
--                                    the pack's frames at natural 1:1 size
--                                    (`hdCell`/`hdCols`/`hdRows`)
-- Regenerate both with tools/rebuild_icon_atlas.mjs.
